  ultimateText: "White Deer Renewal: 0.7s telegraph, spirit deer walks the lane leaving
    a 5s blossom trail \u2014 heals 70% ATK/s inside."
  passiveText: 'Sacred Forest Veins: healed health charges Life Force (capped); a
    full bar adds one pulse to the next secondary skill.'
  minorText: 'Triple Spring Sprouts: plants up to 3 sprouts under the lowest-HP allies
    in Range; grow after 3 pulses. Cooldown 11s.'
  secondMinorText: "Leaf Renewal: harvest a grown sprout to instantly heal a critical
    ally \u2014 the source sprout is lost. Cooldown 9s."
  thirdMinorText: "Spirit Deer Patrol: needs 2+ sprouts \u2014 spirit runs oldest
    to newest, healing a pulse and clearing a Poison/Burn per ally. 13s CD."
